    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid satisfying RecallEmptyCompleteConstraint by inventing records or selecting a weaker operation."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Apply RecallEmptyCompleteConstraint to the explicit scoped records and retain the original evidence."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "The declared records are checked against gmeow:RecallEmptyCompleteConstraint."@x-gmeow-english ;
